lse, "content_type": "comment", "media_id": "3374908304122625340", "status": "Active", "type": 1, "user_id": "15526265", "has_translation": true, "text": "Tokyo giorno 4. \nKm percorsi: circonferenza della terra x3, ho mangiato il ramen più buono della mia vita, ho comprato dei cioccolatini al supermercato che ho scoperto solo dopo fossero un medicinale contro l’ansia, ho provato i soba cold (meh), ordinato natto al ristorante ma era finito, ho comprato una bevanda scoprendo solo dopo fosse gelatina, ho visto il gatto 3d, sono entrata in un posto in cui per chiedere dove fosse il bagno avrei dovuto usare un linguaggio in codice che era MEOW MEOW, ho trattenuto la pipì. Chissà cosa ci attende nei prossimi giorni.", "user": {"strong_id__": "15526265", "pk": "15526265", "pk_id": "15526265", "id": "15526265", "is_unpublished": false, "fbid_v2": "17841401147950242", "username": "camihawke", "full_name": "Camihawke", "is_private": false, "is_verified": true, "profile_pic_id": "3599963566846179660_15526265", "profile_pic_url": "https://scontent-mxp2-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.2885-19/487361057_684224477284393_7381724342902909070_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_s150x150_tt6&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6InByb2ZpbGVfcGljLmRqYW5nby43MTkuYzIifQ&_nc_ht=scontent-mxp2-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_cat=1&_nc_oc=Q6cZ2gHbZz1C3WaJ4rk7dhxbYTCEOqYYQllp85ZmpZMT0GlZsgxsAFEXzvuhhuaAulrP4e0&_nc_ohc=HHEghLUzHLcQ7kNvwEy0YwI&_nc_gid=QIV0pbRQ5EJ5SgdqBKcqEw&edm=ALQROFkBAAAA&ccb=7-5&oh=00_Af9bzyHuB2qJAxBQkzhdoOEXh7TQAfPQrfUjTQd5_wDrgQ&oe=6A266AEC&_nc_sid=fc8dfb"}, "is_covered": false, "private_reply_status": 0, "text_translation": "Tokyo day 4.\nKms traveled: circumference of the earth x3, ate the most delicious ramen of my life, bought chocolates at the supermarket that I only discovered later were an anti-anxiety medicine, tried soba cold (meh), ordered born at the restaurant but it was finished, bought a drink only to discover after it was jelly, i saw the 3d cat, i entered a place where to ask where the bathroom was i s